Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Run Ada on the server and fix punah.pro site bugs

- Proxy /api/ada through nginx to ada_server.py in the Docker image
- Point ada.js at the same-origin API instead of localhost
- Fix canonical, sitemap, robots, config and 404 URLs for semicolon.punah.pro
- Fix typo in GitHub footer link on the Ada page
- Add Ada health check to CI smoke tests
